{
  "name": "Raspberry Pi HAT – GPIO Expander & RTC",
  "description": "A Raspberry Pi HAT that adds 16 additional GPIO pins via the MCP23017 I²C expander and a DS3231 real-time clock module with battery backup. Includes EEPROM for HAT identification (HAT spec requirement), I²C pull-ups, and decoupling capacitors. Great board for learning I²C addressing, level shifting, and HAT compliance.",
